Trace this code and tell me the output:
```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main(void) {
    int s = 0;
    for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
        if (i % 2 == 0) continue;
        s += i;
    }
    printf("%d", s);
    return 0;
}
```

